    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d268-a2">

                <pb facs="0360" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg286"/>

                <head>Mr. Bigelow to Lord Cowley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-03-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 26, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your favor of the 23d instant, communicating the report received by
                    your excellency’s government that a sum of $500,000, being the second instalment
                    of the indemnity due by the Japanese government, under the <pb facs="0361"
                        n="287" xml:id="pg287"/> convention of the 22d October, 1864, bad been
                    received by the Oriental Bank of Yokohama, where it is held at the disposal of
                    the representatives of the four powers.</p>
                <p>Your excellency also informs me that you are instructed to propose that this
                    second instalment should be remitted, to Europe in conformity with the
                    arrangement suggested in the letter addressed to me by; Mr. Ellis on the 19th of
                    December last, in regard to the first payment.</p>
                <p>In conformity with the instructions of my government, and in its behalf, I have
                    the honor to accept the foregoing proposal and to thank your excellency for its
                    communication.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain, my lord, your lordship’s most obedient and most
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN BIGELOW.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency Earl <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cowley, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">&amp;c</hi></hi>.,<hi rendition="#italic">
                            &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
